inally dying in fierce combat.","jp":"漢中太守・蘇固の主簿。初平二年、張魯と張修が漢中を攻め落とし、蘇固は殺害された。主簿の趙嵩は悲憤に堪えず、剣を抜いて張修の軍営へと突入し、十余人を討ち取って張修を捕らえる寸前まで迫ったが、最後は力戦の末に戦死した。","kr":"한중태수 소고의 주부였다. 초평 2년, 장로와 장수가 한중을 함락시키고 소고를 살해했다. 주부 조숭은 비분을 참지 못하고 검을 뽑아 장수의 병영으로 곧장 쳐들어가 연달아 10여 명을 베었으며, 장수를 거의 사로잡을 뻔했으나 끝내 힘써 싸우다 전사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1034615","remark":"普武","surname":"赵","surnameTc":"趙","surnameEn":"Zhao","surnameJp":"趙","surnameKr":"조","surnameOther":"","name":"嵩","nameTc":"嵩","nameEn":"Song","nameJp":"嵩","nameKr":"숭","nameOther":"","word":"伯高","wordTc":"伯高","wordEn":"Bogao","wordJp":"伯高","wordKr":"백고","wordOther":"","icon":"赵嵩","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1036","gender":"0","rule":"67","force":"81","wise":"61","politics":"55","charm":"79","will":"85","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"88/15/85/15/53/56/51/15","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1002700;1009502","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1011905","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5200","battleSoulPoint":"6000","debateSoulPoint":"5000","strategy":"1003008","strategy2":"1000905","professions":"1/3/1/0/0/0/2/2/0/1/3/2/3/2/1/0/1/2/1/0/0/3/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"7","compatible":"64","loyalty":"100","reputation":"11650","evaluate":"3400","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"153","show":"184","death":"191","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1020505","treasure":"","horse":"WP1002315","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;31/1;57/1;44/0;43/0;45/0;33/1;18/0;12/0;10/1;25/1","fathe